<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett Packard upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett Packard upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said that on Monday it raised its rating on Hewlett-Packard Co to outperform from neutral and raised its target price to $71 a share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Shao Wang said that near term demand could brighten, driven in part by new products.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Hewlett-Packard fell 3/16 to 63-5/8 in morning trade.</p>
<p>((Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
